---
// src/components/landing/Solution.astro
---

<section id="solucion" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-muted/30 border-y border-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary mb-6">
        La Solución Definitiva
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-foreground tracking-tight">
        Tu club en piloto automático
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground">
        ClubSport Manager elimina el trabajo manual para que puedas enfocarte en lo que realmente importa: el deporte.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Glow behind the mockup -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-hero opacity-20 blur-3xl rounded-full -z-10 transform scale-90 translate-y-10"></div>
      
      <!-- Mockup Placeholder (Glassmorphism container) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9] relative flex flex-col">
        <!-- Mockup Header/Browser Bar -->
        <div class="h-12 bg-background/80 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center px-4 gap-2 backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-destructive/80"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-warning/80"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-success/80"></div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Mockup Content (Real App Screenshot) -->
        <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full bg-muted">
          <img src="/ss3.png" alt="Pantalla interior de ClubSport Manager" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature highlights under mockup -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Notificaciones Automáticas</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Los padres reciben confirmaciones de pagos, citaciones a partidos y recordatorios sin que tú muevas un dedo.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Cobros Inteligentes</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">El sistema detecta automáticamente quién no ha pagado y envía los recordatorios por ti. Incrementa tu recaudo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/><path d="M8 14h.01"/><path d="M12 14h.01"/><path d="M16 14h.01"/><path d="M8 18h.01"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/><path d="M16 18h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Asistencia en Tiempo Real</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Control desde el celular. Los padres saben de inmediato si su hijo asistió al entrenamiento.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes slideIn {
    0% { transform: translateX(-100%); opacity: 0; }
    20% { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
    80% { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes slideUp {
    0% { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0; }
    20% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    80% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; }
  }
</style>
